# Issue responses and other per-report working notes stay local: they are written
# for a reporter, not for the published repository. Durable findings belong in
# CHANGELOG.md or docs/releases/, and the deferred list in docs/. The pattern is
# ignored rather than merely untracked so a later `git add -A` cannot pick it up.
docs/issues/
